[Build]
Project build complete. To flash, run:
ESP-IDF: Flash your project in the ESP-IDF Visual Studio Code Extension
or in a ESP-IDF Terminal:
idf.py flash
or
idf.py -p /dev/ttyACM0 flash
or
python -m esptool --chip esp32c3 -b 460800 --before default_reset --after hard_reset  --port /dev/ttyACM0 write_flash --flash_mode dio --flash_size 2MB --flash_freq 80m 0x0 bootloader/bootloader.bin 0x10000 doorlock_ble.bin 0x8000 partition_table/partition-table.bin 
or from the "/home/olgun/CODE/doorlock_ble/doorlock_ble/build" directory
python -m esptool --chip esp32c3 -b 460800 --before default_reset --after hard_reset write_flash "@flash_args"
[/Build]
